plugins/graph-wiki/CLAUDE.md:21:The plugin's `skills/graph-wiki/scripts/*.py` are **thin shims**: each one imports `main()` from `wiki_io.<name>` (claude branch) or shells out to `graph-wiki-agent <cmd>` (bedrock branch, opt-in). There is also `_config.py` for backend selection between Claude (default) and the optional `graph-wiki-agent` Bedrock CLI.
